; Treadmill (issue #934): a mid-size symmetric floor split into two opposing
; belts that carry fighters in towards a mud patch where they meet. A bounce
; pad at each outer end throws a fighter onto a ledge above it, so the way back
; up is a ride, and the ledges (where the spawns and pickups sit) are 230 px
; over the floor, and a small deck hangs 148 px over the mud, both past the
; 128 px headroom rule (#665).
; Not competitive; no hill, so no mode weights.

[node name="Treadmill" type="Node2D"]
script = ExtResource("script")
background_sky_top = Color(0.16, 0.13, 0.12, 1)
background_sky_bottom = Color(0.3, 0.24, 0.2, 1)
background_silhouette = Color(0.1, 0.09, 0.09, 1)
background_layers = PackedStringArray("clouds", "mountains", "hills")
competitive = false

